message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Consent banners on ecommerce storefronts"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Aksan
    given-names: Ceyhun
    alias: ceaksan
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24218378"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ceaksan/storefront-consent-banners"
abstract: >-
  How ecommerce storefronts present cookie consent on their homepage, on desktop and
  on mobile, as a first-time visitor sees it. v1 covers 1587 storefronts on three
  Turkish SaaS ecommerce platforms, one row per site and viewport, with coded
  platforms and vendors and coarsened measurements. Sectors were classified by two
  local open-weight models with human review where they disagreed; the code and parts
  of the datasheet were written and reviewed with AI coding assistants (Claude Code,
  OpenAI Codex); banner labels and editorial decisions were made by a person.
keywords:
  - cookie consent
  - consent banner
  - ecommerce
  - KVKK
